<section class="dl-page dl-page--maison">
  <div class="dl-page-hero">
    <div class="dl-page-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</div>
    <h1 class="dl-page-title">{{ section.settings.title }}</h1>
    <div class="dl-page-intro rte">{{ section.settings.intro }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="dl-page-image dl-page-image--band">
    {% if section.settings.hero_image != blank %}
      {{ section.settings.hero_image | image_url: width: 2200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.hero_image_alt, class: 'dl-image-tag' }}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  <p class="dl-page-caption">{{ section.settings.hero_caption }}</p>

  <div class="dl-page-section">
    <h2>{{ section.settings.origins_title }}</h2>
    <div class="rte">{{ section.settings.origins_text }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="dl-page-quote">
    <p>{{ section.settings.quote_text }}</p>
    <cite>{{ section.settings.quote_cite }}</cite>
  </div>

  <div class="dl-page-section">
    <div class="rte">{{ section.settings.middle_text }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="dl-page-image dl-page-image--portrait">
    {% if section.settings.founder_image != blank %}
      {{ section.settings.founder_image | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.founder_image_alt, class: 'dl-image-tag' }}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  <p class="dl-page-caption">{{ section.settings.founder_caption }}</p>

  <div class="dl-page-divider"></div>

  <div class="dl-page-section">
    <h2>{{ section.settings.today_title }}</h2>
    <div class="rte">{{ section.settings.today_text }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="dl-page-image dl-page-image--band">
    {% if section.settings.archive_image != blank %}
      {{ section.settings.archive_image | image_url: width: 2200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.archive_image_alt, class: 'dl-image-tag' }}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  <p class="dl-page-caption">{{ section.settings.archive_caption }}</p>

  <div class="dl-page-section">
    <h2>{{ section.settings.heritage_title }}</h2>
    <div class="rte">{{ section.settings.heritage_text }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="dl-page-close">
    <div class="rte">{{ section.settings.close_text }}</div>
    <p><a href="mailto:{{ section.settings.concierge_email }}">{{ section.settings.concierge_email }}</a></p>
    <div class="dl-page-sig">{{ section.settings.signature }}</div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dl-page--maison { max-width: 100%; color: #1a1a1a; font-family: 'Futura PT', 'Jost', sans-serif; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.7; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-hero { text-align: center; padding: 80px 24px 40px; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-eyebrow { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6c6c6c; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-title { font-family: 'Futura PT', sans-serif; font-weight: 300; font-size: 46px; letter-spacing: 0.005em; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px; color: #1a1a1a; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-intro { font-family: 'Futura PT', sans-serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.55; color: #3a3a3a; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-image { width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-top: 1px solid #ececec; border-bottom: 1px solid #ececec; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-image-tag { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-image--band { max-width: 1280px; aspect-ratio: 21/9; overflow: hidden; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-image--portrait { max-width: 320px; aspect-ratio: 3/4; margin: 40px auto; border-top: none; border-bottom: none; background: transparent; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-section { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 70px 24px; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-section h2 { font-family: 'Futura PT', sans-serif; font-weight: 300; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 0.01em; margin: 0 0 24px; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.2; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-section p { font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #2a2a2a; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-divider { width: 40px; height: 1px; background: #d4d4d0; margin: 0 auto; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-quote { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 24px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #ececec; border-bottom: 1px solid #ececec; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-quote p { font-family: 'Futura PT', sans-serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.3; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0 0 20px; letter-spacing: 0.005em; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-quote cite { font-family: 'Futura PT', 'Jost', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6c6c6c; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-caption { text-align: center; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6c6c6c; margin: 16px auto 0; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-close { text-align: center; padding: 80px 24px 100px; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-close p { font-size: 16px; color: #3a3a3a; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-close a { color: #1a1a1a; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .dl-page--maison .dl-page-close .dl-page-sig { font-family: 'Futura PT', sans-serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 14px; color: #6c6c6c; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 22px; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .dl-page--maison .dl-page-hero { padding: 56px 20px 32px; }
    .dl-page--maison .dl-page-title { font-size: 34px; }
    .dl-page--maison .dl-page-intro { font-size: 17px; }
    .dl-page--maison .dl-page-section { padding: 50px 20px; }
    .dl-page--maison .dl-page-image--band { aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
    .dl-page--maison .dl-page-image--portrait { max-width: 220px; margin: 24px auto; }
    .dl-page--maison .dl-page-quote { padding: 40px 20px; }
    .dl-page--maison .dl-page-quote p { font-size: 22px; }
    .dl-page--maison .dl-page-close { padding: 56px 20px 80px; }
  }
</style>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "AboutPage",
  "name": "The Maison — De Leville",
  "url": "{{ shop.url }}/pages/the-maison",
  "description": {{ section.settings.intro | strip_html | json }},
  "speakable": {
    "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
    "cssSelector": [".dl-page-intro", ".dl-page-quote"]
  },
  "about": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "@id": "https://deleville.co/#organization"
  }
}
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "SNC The Maison Page",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "The Maison" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title", "default": "A Roman house. Born 1975." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "intro", "label": "Intro", "default": "<p>Fifty years of Italian craftsmanship. One family. One line, carried forward.</p>" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "hero_image", "label": "Hero band image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hero_image_alt", "label": "Hero image alt", "default": "Rome" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hero_caption", "label": "Hero caption", "default": "Roma" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "origins_title", "label": "Origins title", "default": "Origins." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "origins_text", "label": "Origins text", "default": "<p>De Leville was founded in Rome in 1975 by Eliau Labi, at Piazza Esquilino 10. From the beginning, the maison was devoted to objects of beauty — leather goods and accessories shaped by Italian craftsmanship, finished by hand, built to be kept.</p><p>The name above the door was his. The script he drew that year has never been redrawn. It is the same line you see today.</p><p>He believed that objects of beauty hold the power to carry memory. He wanted a house that could sit quietly beside Cartier, Hermès and Bulgari — not louder, not larger, simply as certain.</p><p>He worked with his hands, through his children's hands — drawing, commissioning, supervising — until he could no longer. In the 1990s the atelier fell quiet. The drawings went into a folder. The line was never broken. It was only waiting.</p><p>Before he passed, at home in Rome, he turned to his wife Simcha and said five words. She carried them for years, and then she gave them to his grandson — named for him, Eliau.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "quote_text", "label": "Quote text", "default": "\"I see De Leville going up, and up, and up.\"" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "quote_cite", "label": "Quote cite", "default": "— Eliau Labi · his last words, to his wife Simcha" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "middle_text", "label": "Middle text", "default": "<p>Dreams become real when acted upon. What he had drawn was never small — and the house he began was never meant to end.</p>" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "founder_image", "label": "Founder portrait image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "founder_image_alt", "label": "Founder image alt", "default": "Eliau Labi, founder" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "founder_caption", "label": "Founder caption", "default": "Eliau Labi · Founder · 1975" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "today_title", "label": "Today title", "default": "The Maison today." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "today_text", "label": "Today text", "default": "<p>De Leville is led today by Eliau Piha — grandson of the founder, named after him. The maison has returned to its work: objects of timeless elegance, made by hand, made to order, made to be kept.</p><p>The line his grandfather drew in 1975 has become the jewelry itself. The <em>Classico</em> is his motif, cut through 18-karat gold. The <em>Incontro</em> is two halves of his signature, meeting. The <em>Mezza Luna</em> is the curve of a letter he drew, made into a ring.</p><p>You are not wearing a ring. You are wearing something he wrote in 1975.</p><p>Every piece is finished by hand and numbered. Each arrives with a Digital Soul — a blockchain-authenticated certificate of origin, ownership and provenance. A permanent record of the object, and of the hand that made it.</p>" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "archive_image", "label": "Archive band image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "archive_image_alt", "label": "Archive image alt", "default": "De Leville at Piazza Esquilino 10, Rome, c. 1975" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "archive_caption", "label": "Archive caption", "default": "Piazza Esquilino 10 · Roma · c. 1975" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heritage_title", "label": "Heritage title", "default": "Heritage." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "heritage_text", "label": "Heritage text", "default": "<p>Fifty years of artisanal craftsmanship sit behind every piece. The devotion to Italian craftsmanship that began at Piazza Esquilino 10 continues today from our atelier in New York — the same standard, the same hand, the same line.</p><p>Rome gave us the drawing. New York carries it forward.</p><p>A legacy is not a story told once. It is a line that keeps being drawn.</p>" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "close_text", "label": "Closing text", "default": "<p>Thank you for carrying it forward.</p>" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "concierge_email", "label": "Concierge email", "default": "concierge@deleville.co" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "signature", "label": "Signature", "default": "Eliau Piha · Grandson · De Leville" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "SNC The Maison Page" }]
}
{% endschema %}
